        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jennifer Ventimilia, Joshua Sternin, Dave Pressler, Al Jean, Mike Reiss\n- TV Series: The Simpsons, Robot and Monster\n- TV Episodes: Simpson Tide, 'Round Springfield\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n\nFacts:\n- \"'Round Springfield\" is the 22nd episode of the sixth season of \"The Simpsons.\"\n- Jennifer Ventimilia co-wrote the \"The Simpsons\" episode \"Simpson Tide\" with Joshua Sternin.\n- Jennifer Ventimilia wrote the teleplay for the \"The Simpsons\" episode \"'Round Springfield\" based on a story idea by Al Jean and Mike Reiss.\n- Dave Pressler created and produced the short-lived Nickelodeon series \"Robot and Monster\" with Joshua Sternin and Jennifer Ventimilia.\n- Dave Pressler is perhaps best known for the Emmy-nominated Nickelodeon series \"Robot and Monster.\"",
